        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=\\sqrt{65}$.",
          "worked": "Let $d$ be the shared diagonal.\n$$\\begin{align*}d^2&=5^2+2^2\\\\d^2&=29\\\\x^2&=d^2+6^2\\\\x^2&=29+36\\\\x^2&=65\\\\x&=\\sqrt{65}\\end{align*}$$",
