          "short": "$x=2\\sqrt5$.\n\nUse the shared diagonal to relate the two right triangles.",
          "worked": "Let $d$ be the shared diagonal.\n$$\\begin{align*}d^2&=x^2+3^2\\\\d^2&=x^2+9\\\\x^2+d^2&=7^2\\\\x^2+(x^2+9)&=49\\\\2x^2&=40\\\\x^2&=20\\\\x&=2\\sqrt5\\end{align*}$$",
