          "short": "$x=\\sqrt{10}$.\n\nExpress the shared altitude squared using each triangle.",
          "worked": "Let $h$ be the shared altitude.\n$$\\begin{align*}h^2+2^2&=x^2\\\\h^2&=x^2-4\\\\h^2+x^2&=4^2\\\\(x^2-4)+x^2&=16\\\\2x^2&=20\\\\x^2&=10\\\\x&=\\sqrt{10}\\end{align*}$$",
